      <title>I’m trolled on TikTok but social media is driving customers to our farm shop</title>
      <link>https://www.independent.ie/farming/comment/im-trolled-on-tiktok-but-social-media-is-driving-customers-to-our-farm-shop/a1357462964.html</link>
      <description>“I see you and your stuff on social media” is a phrase that is heard all the time in the farm shop from everyone between 20 years of age up to 80. As far as I can tell, the young men find us on TikTok, the yummy mummies and young women find us on Instagram and the older ladies and gentlemen who like old-fashioned steaks and rounds of bacon follow our progress on Facebook.</description>
