      <title>We transferred the farm to our son but his new relationship has us terrified for its future</title>
      <link>https://www.independent.ie/farming/legal-advice/we-transferred-the-farm-to-our-son-but-his-new-relationship-has-us-terrified-for-its-future/a1095883712.html</link>
      <description>Query: Dear Mary Frances I am writing in the hope that you can shed some light on a situation that is causing deep upset in our family. My husband and I transferred our family farm to one of our sons. He was always the one who showed the most interest in the land. He worked alongside us from a young age, talked constantly about his plans for the place, and seemed committed to carrying on the family tradition.</description>
